tion-title\">2、结构与秩序</p>\n\n  <p class=\"main-bullet-text\">将教具按照其难度加以排列，<span class=\"wavy-underline\">较有秩序及结构感</span>。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"sub-bullet-text\"><span class=\"wavy-underline\">养成儿童自动自发、物归原处的生活习惯</span>。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"sub-bullet-text\">外在环境的结构只是为配合儿童的学习，</p>\n  <p class=\"text-block\" style=\"padding-left:20px;\">教师们应视儿童的需要而适时更换教室的陈设，</p>\n  <p class=\"last-line\"><span class=\"wavy-underline\">在有序中保持弹性</span>。</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
